Maybe you typoed, but you only need XP14 to go on the quest... as for
your low HP, what is your Con?  If it's rather high, then you've just
had really bad luck with HP rolls.  To prevent loss of armor, find a
safe room.  Lock the doors if possible... enscribe the E-word if you
feel like it.  Then take off all armor before reading (if destroy
armor is all you're worried about).  With no armor on, and the scroll
is not cursed, you will get the message "Your skin itches."  You then
know this to be the scroll of destroy armor.  This will abuse your STR
and CON, but that's probably a minor affect at this point.

Beware scrolls of amnesia, punishment, fire, etc...

I typically will go ahead and tunnel down below Medusa and come up
from below (put on the blindfold/towel first).  There is a chance that
there is something in the room with her that might help you.  If not,
you can always go in the front door of the castle, kill everything
within, and get the WoWish.  Then you can wish up ring/boots of lev.
or water walking boots, or... you get the point.

